# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
# Dependency locks are normally committed. They are not here yet, because a lock file written
# without access to registry.terraform.io records only one platform and no registry checksums,
# and an incomplete lock breaks `terraform init` on every other platform. Generate and commit
# them once (infra/terraform/README.md) and delete this line.
.terraform.lock.hcl
# Shared provider cache used by `make tf-validate` (one download instead of seven).
.terraform-plugin-cache/
# Account-specific, and not committed: the state bucket name and the ARNs usually carry the
# account id. Copy the .example files beside them (infra/terraform/README.md).
infra/terraform/**/terraform.tfvars
infra/terraform/**/backend.hcl

# Env and OS
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store

# Generated from /content by `brain graph` and scripts/build-logos.mjs
apps/web/src/data/graph.json
apps/web/src/data/logos.json

# Generated by `brain embed`: vector index and downloaded embedding model
apps/api/data/
